{"server":"tw","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_01_end","groupId":"act41side","stageId":"act41side_01","title":"扉頁所見","storyCode":"EA-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"3dd6d7e2c6b2b62a266b1e3998257eb04cca30a64cfc6c095ef4f870b4dcceaa","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g3_dragonsquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）……抱歉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，請留步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，葦草，是你！你之前突然離席，我還以為是我們的招待有什麼不周到的地方呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不，我很感謝你們的款待，只是當時突然想起還有事。現在我還有一些問題，能請您為我解答嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以，你問吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道自己身上正燃燒著火焰嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火？你是說祝福？真奇怪，你竟然能看見其他人身上的祝福？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是被人提醒才意識到的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你是說你知道，但你們都看不見？這怎麼可能呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"居民將手伸向自己腰間。\n為了驅散沼澤中的黑霧，塔拉人的祖先會在腰間佩戴一朵以源石技藝固定住的小小的火焰。\n這樣的習俗在維多利亞徹底掌控塔拉後被嚴令禁止。\n時移世異，不必再顧及維多利亞禁令的塔拉人，至少是納斯爾紗人，選擇在腰間佩戴小巧的源石燈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也知道燃料不夠，加上宵禁存在，所以我們開不起源石燈，也不必開。不過……只要像這樣……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她的火……在這個燈上顯現出了顏色……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在城裡人一開燈就是這個顏色，換了其他顏色的元件也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你們都不擔心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也看到了，現在納斯爾紗正在變好，所以這只能是紅龍的祝福，不會有別的解釋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"可是？\n可是一個魯莽的歸鄉者，要告訴她這個火的存在與不祥有關？她不會相信的。\n也許直接一些的辦法反而會奏效，拉芙希妮在心中如此祈禱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我也想感受一下“紅龍的祝福”，所以……我能握一下您的手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你都進城了，城市裡的人遲早會得到的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一個小小的心願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，特意回到塔拉，你也不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你是做什麼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我會一些醫療手段，我的源石技藝可以輔助我，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你是個醫生，城裡剛好需要醫生呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，讓我們握手——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她握緊女人掌心帶著老繭的手，同時讓火從自己的手腕處往對方蔓延。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她閉上眼。\n閉上眼，去回憶那些曾被自己撫平痛苦，不再被迫滯留人世的對象——\n去溫暖這股冰冷的火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紫色的火逐漸褪去。在那之下，蒼白的、搖曳著友善笑容的面龐慢慢清晰起來。\n於是她試圖將更多紫色的部分消去，卻沒能及時看見女人面色陡變的一瞬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的手——你對我的手做了什麼？我的手沒感覺了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有我的祝福，我也感受不到了！你到底在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放開我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“守靈人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葦草！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“守靈人”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“守靈人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葦草小姐，請先放開這位可憐的女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“守靈人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“守靈人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“守靈人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位葦草小姐沒有惡意，我以我的人格保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是她說她是醫生，醫生怎麼會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“守靈人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"基於源石技藝的醫術偶爾也會有一些副作用。看，你的手，現在不是好好的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我還是感覺不到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“守靈人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不會有事的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"離群的守靈人抬手，以溫熱的掌心輕撫受驚女人的前額。明明不是什麼奇異的動作，卻逐漸讓女人安定下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好，我相信你。是的，我的手還在，祝福也還在……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“守靈人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜幕就快降臨了，還是儘快回到房屋之中吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“守靈人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葦草小姐，您也還有另一場宴會要參加，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宴會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯，宴會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“守靈人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，現在，請允許我為您引路離開這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g3_dragonsquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“守靈人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“守靈人”，既然你回來了，那代表莫蘭他們已經安頓下來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“守靈人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，他們會住在遺跡靠近外圍的地方。現在這個時間，大概還在清掃遺跡旁那些無人的小屋吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“守靈人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用謝。要說的話，我更希望您能稱呼我為“涅梅絲”，因為我如今的工作已與守靈人相去甚遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，涅梅絲。你剛剛提到宴會……誰要舉辦宴會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾天之後，深池會開一場慶功會，所有高層的人物都會參加，愛布拉娜殿下也在其中。我最近就在忙這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慶功會？在居民們用馬鈴薯充當“燉肉”和“烤鱗”的時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬鈴薯的事起初是因為匱乏，後來人們就只是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"習慣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但深池也知道城裡的情況，說是宴會，至少我沒在清單上看到什麼吃喝的環節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是在幫誰粉飾，拉芙希妮小姐。我相信深池不會做出那種置塔拉人於不顧的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，拉芙希妮小姐，我得先離開了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她走得如此匆忙……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果直接祛除紫火會引發恐慌，那麼，假如在大家不知情的情況下，去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"背後的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去把你想要的東西抓在手裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g1_citystreets_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"高尚的紅龍轉身望去，只見一個明晃晃地燃燒著紫火的身影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不，如果說城裡其他的居民“沾染”了火焰，面前這個人倒不如說是紫火凝結成的一樣，看似毫不熾烈，卻連周身的光線都扭曲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，你想要的東西無聊透頂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟塔拉的火焰已經染上了顏色，這是既定的事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道火的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"碰巧知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請把你知道的事情告訴我，這很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴你？憑什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要阻止人們被紫火吞沒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後換上你自己的火，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要這座城的人們能夠安然無恙，火焰的顏色並不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼冠冕堂皇的廢話，簡直都讓人懷念起來了，紅龍。你這個藉口拙劣到好笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你和我姐姐……有什麼關係？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉芙希妮向前踏出一步，那身影也往後退了一步，和她保持著距離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關係？你、你的姐姐還有我，我們本性相同，我們都渴望權力、爭鬥、殘殺……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都對接下來要發生的事情摩拳擦掌，恨不得現在就用火燒光一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這次我棄權。在這座巢穴被火焰焚盡之前，我會為你們兩邊同時助威的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅龍試圖將生命的火焰編織成牢籠，但在牢籠成型之前，那個身影早已被風吹散了。\n火只是短暫地照亮了那個影子長長的尾巴……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"而後歸於虛無。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"是你啊。怎麼了，這種時候跑來見我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"別告訴我你的糧店又出了什麼問題要我處理。我從來都沒有把你當下屬，我們是“生意夥伴”，懂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"懂了就好。我這裡又有一批貨需要你送出城。等等就出發，宵禁之前回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，我說的就是這個——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"哪個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前運出城的那些穀物……您說過不會影響城內正常糧食供應的，但現在大家還是只能吃馬鈴薯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"那你知道塔拉的其他地方是什麼情況嗎？他們連馬鈴薯都沒得吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"納斯爾紗的農產品產量已經很高了，事急從權，我們是在幫助自己的同胞，懂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"而且光是上次那幾批大麥，你就從裡面賺了多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"退一萬步講，納斯爾紗人也不是沒得吃了，起碼馬鈴薯還能填飽肚子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"更不用說那些農業地塊很快就能收穫，到時候還有更多新的糧食，我還怕你的糧店賣不出去呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"不過呢，我也不喜歡勉強。如果你實在過意不去，那就把你的經營許可轉讓出來，糧店也別開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我吃什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"都說了，你不是我的下屬。我為什麼要管生意夥伴吃什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，等等把許可交上來吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，老爺，不要！我願意的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"還站在這裡不走幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一件事，我聽朋友說，林中的黑霧最近可能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"黑霧？如果連這個都需要你提醒，那我也不用幹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"像往常一樣，出城門之後自然有人接應，剩下的事不需要你來操心。走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？早上“校官”來巡查的時候，那個傢伙說什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，“校官”大人上午沒來。領袖派他去做別的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"那你這麼慌張是為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是南部的農業地塊已經正式進入收穫期了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是好事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，但，那個，畢竟城裡的熟悉農業工人都不在了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，手冊上怎麼說，你們就怎麼做，懂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，整個地塊的產量預估有多少？回報給我，到時候我整理一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也是第一次做這種工作……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"沒用的東西！莊稼熟了沒都看不出來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定是熟了，不然我們也不可能收……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“官僚”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"那不就是一切正常嗎？按照往年的正常產量匯報！回去回去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g3_dragonsquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我是遊牧人布莉吉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在納斯爾紗城裡的信都送完了。我想去納斯爾紗的最高點，讓風把我的消息帶給我的兄弟姐妹們，然後我就離開城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我想起來了，是你啊。來了這麼多次，我們沒有一次放你上去，怎麼就是學不乖呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就連維多利亞人在這裡的時候，他們也允許我去堡壘的高處的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得我是維多利亞人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你是塔拉人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就該知道，都是塔拉人，我們就沒必要再忍受你們那些老掉牙的臭毛病。什麼遊牧人啊守靈人啊，簡直裝神弄鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！再不走，小心我把你抓起來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……走就走，有必要生氣嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g7_blackforest_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了送信，其他事情都沒辦好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，至少趕在宵禁之前出城了，現在只需要穿過黑林，回到原野上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，但願林中的黑霧會讓我過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過黑霧一向不阻攔遊牧人的，我擔心這個幹嘛呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"遊牧人踢了一腳路邊的落葉，讓沙沙的聲響迴盪在眼前空曠的深林裡。\n出乎她的意料，這聲音並未逐漸停下，而是形成了反覆的回音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"於是布莉吉猛地蹲下身去，試圖摀住眼前那些散碎的葉片。聲音正從那裡傳來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，不該踢你們的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"回音仍未停止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g8_blackforest_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"聲浪不僅沒有停止，甚至迴響得越來越大，越來越大，直至變成令人難以忍受、震耳欲聾的噪音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"與此同時，黑霧從她的腳邊漫上來，摀上她的眼睛，堵住她的耳朵——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g7_blackforest_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到她發現自己又回到了黑林的入口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g7_blackforest_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……第五次！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不打算放我離開，非要讓我回城裡，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我不會回去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大不了去黑林外面搭個帳篷度過幾晚，總有我能離開的時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
